# The /pi-improve workflow writes per-cycle artefacts under
# docs/agent-improvement/cycles/<cycle-id>/: cycle-state.json, the numbered phase
# reports, raw evidence and findings. See docs/agent-improvement/README.md for the
# schema and the six-phase contract, and docs/agent-improvement/autonomous-workflow.md
# for the Codex variant.
#
# The two dated directories alongside this file are historical cycle records, ported
# from the predecessor kit so the loop's output format has real worked examples. They
# are archives, not tracking of current work. A new cycle is written here as it runs;
# whether its raw evidence is committed is a per-cycle decision.
#
# This placeholder keeps the expected destination directory present so the workflow
# and its resume hook can always find it.
